<title>NETHERLANDS: VASTNED OFFICES/INDUSTRIAL Q1 NET RISES.</title>
<headline>VASTNED OFFICES/INDUSTRIAL Q1 NET RISES.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Direct investment result (net profit)  15.8  vs   6.5</p>
<p>    ditto per share (guilders)		  1.55 vs   1.17</p>
<p>    Investment portfolio			978    vs 519*</p>
<p>    Group equity				  636    vs 373*</p>
<p>* NOTE - comparisons for investment portfolio and group</p>
<p>equity as per end-1996.</p>
<p>NOTE - Property investment group VastNed Offices/Industrial</p>
<p>NV said its 1997 first quarter profit per share had been</p>
<p>positively affected by a one-off interest gain of 0.30 guilders.</p>
<p>The company reiterated its forecast that it expected higher</p>
<p>full-year net profits per share than 1996's 4.88 guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
